  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 375°F (190°C).",
    "Heat the ghee in a large ceramic tagine over medium heat.",
    "Add the air-fried chicken breast and cook until browned on all sides.",
    "Add the clotted cream, Greek yogurt, saffron, turmeric, cumin, salt, and black pepper. Stir to combine.",
    "Bring the mixture to a simmer and cook for 10 minutes.",
    "Add the pumpkin, dates, and pistachios. Stir to combine.",
    "Cover the tagine and transfer it to the preheated oven.",
    "Bake for 20 minutes or until the tagine is hot and the flavors have melded together.",
    "Sprinkle chopped fresh cilantro on top of the tagine before serving.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with additional cilantro if desired.",
    "Ensure poultry is cooked to an internal temperature of 74°C / 165°F (juices run clear, no pink remaining) before serving."
